# XDP 测试结果 - 2026-04-23

## 测试 1: XDP_PASS
ip link set dev nds14s xdp obj bpf/xdp_pass_kern.o sec xdp_pass
ip link show nds14s:
  xdp qdisc mq prog/xdp id 40

ethtool -S nds14s:
  xdp_pass: 3
  xdp_prog_set: 1

## 测试 2: XDP_DROP 替换 XDP_PASS
ip link set dev nds14s xdp off
ip link set dev nds14s xdp obj bpf/xdp_drop_kern.o sec xdp_drop
ip link show nds14s:
  xdp qdisc mq prog/xdp id 48

ethtool -S nds14s:
  xdp_pass: 6
  xdp_drop: 1
  xdp_prog_set: 2
  xdp_prog_clear: 1

## 结论
- Bug #1 (XDP_DROP 语义): xdp_drop=1, tcpdump 看不到包 ✓
- Bug #2 (program 替换引用): xdp_prog_set=2, xdp_prog_clear=1, 无泄漏 ✓
